From 9b78335d130d3eac06b0620bd56ef82c5c3a05e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:02:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] library: regenerate the JSON-LD for the library entry IRI
 (cat-harness-tools a3a915bc)

cat-harness-tools a3a915bc (owner cards Q-THIN-6 B, Q-THIN-8 A) names a
library entry's manifest by .../assets/library/jsonld/<layer>/source/<id>
instead of .../<layer>/<id>/manifest.jsonld. At the re-pinned tools
(ed3c8eb, #64) gen:jsonld:check reported all 442 library nodes stale,
which made smart-ips-pilgrimage#66's gates fail. Regenerated with
`bun run cat-harness-tools/pipeline/gen-library-jsonld.ts` in a tree
composed from #66's lock; only the @id/derivedFrom/sourceDocument IRIs
change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EucfRmaYQQrwnsT3uqd74C
